{
  "id": "314301",
  "resourceId": 143,
  "name": "米爾克：花漾兔女郎",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c143_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c143_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "是因為委託才穿成這樣的。\n你、你可別想歪了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "好尷尬好尷尬……\n這種裝扮根本不適合我！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "啊，都說了不要一直說我可愛！\n再說我就要揍人了！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "……所、所以呢，你喜歡嗎？\n才不是特地穿給老兄看的，\n只、只是有點在意罷了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "偶爾……\n像這樣打扮一下似乎也不錯呢。\n畢竟有人喜歡看。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "你知道嗎？老兄也蠻……\n那個……我是說……蠻、蠻帥氣的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "……呼。趁現在趕快喘口氣。\n用這種裝扮跟老兄待在一起，\n我的心臟有點受不了……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "老兄，老兄～在做什麼呢？在忙嗎？\n……才、才不是想引起老兄的注意，\n就是有點無聊啦。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "呃……等等。\n如果被舒格和普琳瑪看到我這副打扮……！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "老兄要不要也穿穿看兔女郎裝？\n哈哈哈，抱歉抱歉。光想就好好笑。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "……總覺得看到好多兔女郎，好奇怪。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼樣？本米爾克大人的兔女郎……\n不、不是叫你看那邊啦，臭小子！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "看起來怎麼樣？是不是覺得變很強？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "才不可能是因為兔女郎裝的關係變強。\n老兄知道為什麼嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "只要有老兄在，我要變多強都可以。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "感覺我總是單方面地接受老兄的好意。\n老兄，謝謝你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "你想收到什麼作為回報？儘管說。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈哈。你喜歡兔女郎喜歡到想送禮物的程度嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "你喜歡的是兔女郎還是我？\n雖然我已經知道答案了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "漸漸了解老兄之後，就變得越來越喜歡。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "……我，好像非常喜歡老兄呢。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "我真的要穿這樣出場嗎？\n……老兄？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "老兄的喜好真是……\n不過沒差。走吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "問我穿高跟鞋沒問題嗎？\n你把我這個米爾克大人當成什麼——呃啊？！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "……從記憶裡刪掉我跌倒的畫面。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "有沒有被兔女郎打過啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "兔子其實是肉食性動物！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "難以行動也不成問題！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "呃，腳好痛……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "比想像中還要緊……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "衣服不會破掉吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "老兄！我準備好了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "該死。不、不要那樣看我！！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "去死！去死！去死！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈哈！下一個！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "我是殺手兔啦，你這傢伙！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "擺平一個！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "呀？！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "啊，可惡……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "都、都是因為老兄一直那樣看……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈哈！穿著這種衣服戰鬥也很有趣呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}